The integer value printed by the ANSI-C program given below is ______.<br><pre><code>#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;
int funcp(){
   static int x = 1;
   x++;
   return x;
}
int main(){
   int x,y;
   x = funcp();
   y = funcp()+x;
   printf("%d\n", (x+y));
   return 0;
}
</code></pre>

